                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Nostalgia was a big factor in playing Zuma’s Revenge — I played the original Zuma a lot as a kid. But now, a part of me felt almost ashamed. Why spend time with these old, “primitive” games when Cyberpunk 2077 or Disco Elysium collect virtual dust in my library? The answer was simple — because I was having a lot of fun. No story, no characters to follow, no drama. Just pure gameplay.",
